  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SALAR: Support to Public Administration Reform in Moldova 2025-2028</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SALAR: Support to Public Administration Reform in Moldova 2025-2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall objective (impact): Strengthened LPAs within an enhanced framework for local governance improve service provision to citizens in line with the countrys strategic orientation towards EU accession.

Component 1: Coordination of local governance
Outcome: Improved central coordination of local governance in relation to distribution of functions, local PAR, service delivery, and inter-ministerial coordination.

Component 2: Service delivery in selected LPAs
Outcome: Selected clusters of LPAs improve joint provision of public services in line with strategic priorities defined together with citizens.

Component 3: Local engagement in EU integration
Outcome: LPA engagement in the EU accession process strengthened and local access to EU funds facilitated.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2024 it was agreed to support an Inception phase and to work more thoroughly on the concept of support that would cover local and central administration reform as well as EU integration agenda.
The overall objective of the project is: Strengthened local public administration within an enhanced framework for local governance improve service provision to citizens in line with the country&#x2019;s strategic orientation towards EU accession.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">&#xc5;r 2024 enades man om att st&#xf6;dja en inledningsfas och att arbeta mer grundligt med konceptet st&#xf6;d som skulle omfatta reformer av lokal och central f&#xf6;rvaltning samt EU:s integrationsagenda.
Projektets &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r: St&#xe4;rkt lokal offentlig f&#xf6;rvaltning inom ett f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrat ramverk f&#xf6;r lokalt styre och f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad service till medborgarna i linje med landets strategiska inriktning mot EU-medlemskap.</narrative>
  </description>
